WEBVTT

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.070
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.190
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.880
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.640
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.320
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.100
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.760
With you guys

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.900
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.340
If we join forces

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:12.340
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.940
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:23.520
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.020
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.100
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.100
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.100
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.340
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.340
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.340
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.160
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.160
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.320
Toriko and Starjun

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:12.010
fought back after Joie attacked the stadium.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:16.720
However, they were no match for 
Joie's extraordinary power.

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:19.120
Joie's ultimate target is GOD,

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:21.540
so she approaches Komatsu with 
the intent of kidnapping him,

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.520
since he possesses matchless Gourmet Luck.

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.280
But then...

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:29.750
...Zebra, Coco, and Sunny show up.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.180
Toriko gets up again too.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:35.750
In just a moment, the Four Kings 
are going to square off with Joie!

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:44.280
Resuscitation Strike! The 
Four Kings' Ultimate Skill!

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.040
T-Toriko-san!

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.550
Get back, Komatsu!

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:12.490
From here on out, the battle 
is for us Gourmet Hunters!

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:13.540
Komatsu...

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:16.040
No matter what happens, 
I'm gonna protect you!

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.670
O-Okay!

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:27.340
Are you alright, Toriko?

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:32.720
Looks like you guys have been 
put through the wringer too.

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:37.570
I figured out Grinpatch's immune system,

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.340
but I still had a hard time.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:42.480
Me too. Certainly,

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:45.340
I can't say the way I won 
against Tommyrod was beautiful.

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:48.870
You beat Grin and Tommy?

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:53.350
Four Kings... That's how 
strong you've gotten?

00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:02.980
Even though you Four Kings fought 
desperately against Gourmet Corp.,

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:05.260
assembled here, you can defeat <i>me</i>?

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:09.000
You people were lucky.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.300
You made a narrow escape from death.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.900
If we had met back then, 
in the kingdom of Jiddal,

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:20.540
you wouldn't be alive today.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:24.980
We're comin' in!

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:25.680
Uh...

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:29.050
Nobody's here!

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:36.140
You're the one we heard had information

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:38.360
about Acacia's drink, ATOM...

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:40.490
The personal chef to the king of Jiddal?

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.770
Yeah. I'm positive.

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:45.060
And this is also...

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.700
...the Dark Chef...

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:50.970
...Joie!

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:02.350
The Four Kings are finally together?

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:08.340
How long will you let yourself be 
controlled by someone like Joie?

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:11.160
Wake up already, would ya?

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:21.030
Impact Knocking!

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.810
You Knocked yourself?!

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:43.200
Jiro-chan is holding back

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.460
since they're blood relatives...

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:55.400
You still have the habit of 
stepping with your right foot.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:59.940
Before raising your fists to me...

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:05.670
...you need a million years 
more experience, Teppei!

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:08.600
Jiro-chan!

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:09.610
I'm fine.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:13.020
Joie may have been telling the truth.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:16.390
Teppei's power right now...

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:19.060
It's off the scale!

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.830
Se-chan...

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:28.610
I'm gonna capture Teppei!

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:40.380
I don't give a damn who you are.

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:44.920
Anybody who acts cocky like 
that gets no mercy from me!

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:48.690
Machine Gun Voice!

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:52.790
Poison Cannon!

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:54.630
Get back!

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:57.250
Right now, you're only in the way!

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.300
Hair Spit!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.130
You didn't do any damage at all?

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:43.260
Interesting...

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:46.380
Don't complain if the 
whole stadium comes down!

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:50.980
Meteor Noise!

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:10.750
Chaos Cutter!

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.640
Hair Leash!

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:38.460
We won't be able to beat her that easily!

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:39.940
Toriko!

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.300
Continent Cutter!

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:48.820
Bring it on!

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:51.540
You guys adapt to me!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:54.310
You have to harmonize beautifully with me!

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.880
Super Voice Spatula!

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:11.400
God's Cooking: Air Slice!

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:18.240
Machine Gun Sound Poison!

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:31.980
Tornado Leg Boomerang!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.070
Satanic Mince!

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:57.940
T-Toriko-san!

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:04.700
It seems the end is near.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:05.950
Everything is proceeding

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:10.950
according to our plans.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:17.250
The plan was for IGO and Gourmet 
Corp. to destroy each other,

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:21.870
but Joie's appearance has 
accelerated their demise.

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.500
No problem.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:27.510
As soon as our escape is ready,

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:29.560
we're leaving.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:37.240
And thus we wipe our 
hands of the Human World.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.520
Only we, the chosen members of NEO,

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:44.890
can attempt to go forth after this.

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:49.640
And we have tons of the finest ingredients,

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:52.830
saved up from the Gourmet Casino.

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.480
And offering lavish rewards for

00:10:55.480 --> 00:11:01.770
the capture of rare ingredients like 
Century Soup was also part of the plan.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:03.570
This is...

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:06.950
Joie should be rejoining us shortly.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.250
With Chef Komatsu in her care...

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:14.800
That chef's Gourmet Luck is extraordinary.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:17.890
For the sake of NEO's plan,

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:22.230
welcoming him into the fold 
is definitely worthwhile.

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:25.900
Koma-chan!

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:44.950
Thorny Vines.

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:51.080
His skills as a Reviver 
have definitely improved!

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.030
Nail Needle!

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:14.010
Takitsuba broke!

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:16.150
Teppei!

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:17.640
Pressure Cooker!

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:19.480
Ultrahigh pressure!

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:33.700
Alrighty then...

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:48.550
Jiro-chan!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.660
Capturing him alive

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:06.420
is quite a chore.

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:11.670
Teppei's Gourmet Cells were 
changed by Joie's Taste Change.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:14.810
And you sealed them away with Knocking.

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:19.680
That boy is still a handful.

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:24.570
And maybe I've gotten old...

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:28.780
I'm gonna leave the rest up to the young'uns.

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:32.890
I'm sure <i>they'll</i> be able to deal with her.

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:40.800
Toriko-san! Coco-san! Sunny-san!

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.390
Zebra-san!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.430
Chef Komatsu...

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:53.400
The proper thing for you 
to do is work with <i>us</i>.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.620
We welcome you as a member of NEO.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.280
Come.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:04.260
Come with us to a new world.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:08.690
I won't go!

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:10.440
I...

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:12.760
I'm absolutely not going!

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:17.070
There are lots more things I want 
to eat together with Toriko-san...

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.670
There are many more things

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:24.810
I want to make for Toriko-san!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.710
Acacia's Full Course too!

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:32.410
And he said we're going to eat GOD together!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.750
Because Toriko-san and I are partners...

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:43.270
But for you people, who only 
see cooking as a tool...

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:45.280
...I will <i>not</i>...

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:47.750
I won't cook you a damned thing!

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:51.420
It seems you don't understand.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.900
These fools here?

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:58.440
I'm about to murder them all.

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:06.380
But I'll at least give you something 
to think about on the way to Hell.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:09.230
Soon,

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.790
the Gourmet Eclipse will begin.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:18.130
And from Acacia's Full Course, which 
exists in the Gourmet World...

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:19.970
In short,

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:23.330
GOD will also appear shortly.

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:29.540
There are other hidden secrets about GOD,

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.170
but whatever the case,

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.960
the group that claims GOD and monopolizes it

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:39.310
will be us, NEO.

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.690
So you wanna hoard

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:44.760
somethin' that's delicious, huh?

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:48.190
Cocky bastards...

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:53.890
Are you people truly interested 
in nothing but eating?

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.500
You are ignorant about the ultimate value

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.630
of GOD's flavor.

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:04.820
Having sole ownership of GOD

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:08.170
means owning the world.

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:10.400
The flavor of GOD

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:13.530
is a tool that can control the world.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:16.390
What gives it value...

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:19.340
...is that it is a tool!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.300
GOD is...

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:24.000
Anyway...

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:26.970
Anyway, it's delicious

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:30.440
and incredibly precious, so...

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.940
So everyone should eat it together!

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:34.360
And then...

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.390
And then...

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:39.680
That's unfortunate.

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:43.210
They can't eat when they're dead.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:47.350
Before, you said

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:50.070
that we were lucky, right?

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:54.060
But I think I was unlucky in Jiddal.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.310
If it meant being able to get information

00:16:57.310 --> 00:16:59.700
on ATOM from Acacia's Full Course,

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:02.590
I wish I could've met you sooner.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:06.070
For somebody who thinks of things 
so decidedly not beautiful,

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:08.580
I'll never let you have

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:10.140
Acacia's Full Course!

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:15.250
I'll devour Acacia's Full 
Course and anythin' else!

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:18.520
But I'll never let a cocky bastard like you

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:21.790
have the Full Course!

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:24.780
You're not gettin' GOD!

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:29.030
That's gonna be the main dish for 
me and Komatsu's Full Course, see!

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:30.660
Toriko-san!

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:44.500
This is taking longer 
than I thought it would.

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:58.280
You didn't actually

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:02.160
forgot about Gourmet Corp. now, did you?

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:03.230
Star!

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:23.480
You've come into bloom.

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:25.880
You too

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:30.120
are someone who was born 
possessing Gourmet Cell genes.

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:34.010
During my battle with Toriko,

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:36.560
the cells within me

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:38.000
must have been awakened.

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:41.610
And thanks to you,

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:42.750
I've "blossomed".

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.220
Toriko!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.570
Get in step, dammit!

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:57.180
Even in a world that nobody's ever seen

00:21:57.180 --> 00:22:02.740
There's something that can be 
glimpsed if you keep chasing dreams

00:22:02.740 --> 00:22:08.440
Flowers don't bloom on top of asphalt

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:13.600
Come on, let's go make 
only your dreams come true

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:19.340
Mega Raba! The map that you 
draw spreads out into infinity

00:22:19.340 --> 00:22:25.140
Mega Raba! Nobody can stop you

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:31.200
Mega Raba! Let's go forth, 
feeling excitement in our hearts

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:36.580
Let's go find what you've been longing for

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:37.740
Mega Raba

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:40.960
Mega Raba

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:43.600
Mega Raba
